          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እናመሰግንህ ዘንድ ፈቃድህ ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁን በሉኝ።አንድም ኋላ ሙ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተን ተነሥተን ልናመሠግንህ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
